## 🔥 What Is This?

AxisGuard X is a lightweight **Endpoint Detection & Response (EDR)** tool I built from scratch.

It watches your PC in real-time for known hacker tools. The second one runs — it screams, shows it on a live dashboard, and lets you **KILL it in one click**.

Just like CrowdStrike / SentinelOne... but built by me, in my bedroom.

